rue" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448407} :answer-field/id #uuid "4776a07a-b85f-5a19-a13c-2087f8f5df16" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449243} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af0094a7-d9e0-57fc-84a4-bfce73870162" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448408} {:answer/id #uuid "5ad95581-5f03-5403-ae4d-5a62d3cbd6d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448409}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5ad95581-5f03-5403-ae4d-5a62d3cbd6d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448409} :answer-field/id #uuid "b99b2aa8-b962-5194-be9e-f3d0a51b7833" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449244}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9ec28c6e-377f-591a-9037-3511702a70c1" :question/math-academy-id "q-155965" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2-3+1 \\\\ -2-0+2 \\\\ 4-0+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 2{x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is true. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$”; “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120148 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b24b9fb-3a78-5b39-97db-5d260de94782" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448410} {:answer/id #uuid "f64cc72e-31d2-5bec-9c8f-199c1ae77a68" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448411}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5b24b9fb-3a78-5b39-97db-5d260de94782" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448410} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc2eb58e-ea01-5c50-b62f-9127356e961b" :answer-field/key "${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449245} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a16cea7-d0c4-5953-9641-00bd84983fc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448412} {:answer/id #uuid "3fafa4a0-feb2-53eb-9c91-01bf033b7cd6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448413}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3fafa4a0-feb2-53eb-9c91-01bf033b7cd6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448413} :answer-field/id #uuid "90edb75f-056d-51fe-b4d6-0959b7052573" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449246} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1abdbc03-a454-57f6-bb48-be031db06b2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448414} {:answer/id #uuid "20dc8704-4e53-5add-b192-596188f94535" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448415}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "20dc8704-4e53-5add-b192-596188f94535" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448415} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ee14665-3f3f-5d5c-bf70-8e4c97353be2" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449247}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "62e09db0-cf5e-5972-a5d2-6baa771c45b5" :question/math-academy-id "q-155967" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that two vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2} & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly independent” is true. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$”; “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly independent” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120149 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "88045f96-4e5c-56f2-aa3d-094165238e14" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448416} {:answer/id #uuid "2a9e3a90-b6f1-5944-9c06-c0858870b2bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448417}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a9e3a90-b6f1-5944-9c06-c0858870b2bd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448417} :answer-field/id #uuid "592d5ef9-838c-58f7-b2e0-f8df0b00d16c" :answer-field/key "${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449248} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76822f72-cfc5-5fec-9c40-af21257c06e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448418} {:answer/id #uuid "86511923-dda7-5828-95f9-4fb71d5328f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448419}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "76822f72-cfc5-5fec-9c40-af21257c06e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448418} :answer-field/id #uuid "e0ecd9ca-5548-5f7e-8c99-34f1ae5972c9" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449249} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a519d51a-908f-5104-a290-489f7afd4cd7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448420} {:answer/id #uuid "42d3bc50-a4f9-59df-8456-d050d0382bf6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448421}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a519d51a-908f-5104-a290-489f7afd4cd7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448420} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ef3520a-4900-5830-be1a-16e5f59bc604" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449250}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d522f4eb-6fdb-5796-8d35-98401ee7b35b" :question/math-academy-id "q-156591" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+1-2 \\\\ 2+0-2 \\\\ 0+2-2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=1$ and ${x}_{3}=-2.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275376 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e1950ae6-0473-5fe6-8e7a-228cd3690e6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449732} {:answer/id #uuid "bd56d1c9-b738-5348-a8a1-732e246f1ee0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449733}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e1950ae6-0473-5fe6-8e7a-228cd3690e6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449732} :answer-field/id #uuid "b8f7bc3c-eb1f-599b-8029-2012a610c8f5" :answer-field/key "$-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450820} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3864cbe3-89b6-5159-97a9-37efb82c2a2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449734} {:answer/id #uuid "1fabce41-348a-50ae-8ad9-61713e395e31" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449735}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1fabce41-348a-50ae-8ad9-61713e395e31" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449735} :answer-field/id #uuid "75419a8e-9154-5aff-96c8-21ca3990f7be" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450821} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d16d616a-43e7-5149-b235-d90ebb093d73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449736} {:answer/id #uuid "aca33250-948f-5f9f-9edd-8103499ab8a5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449737}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d16d616a-43e7-5149-b235-d90ebb093d73" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449736} :answer-field/id #uuid "44699a4d-8bdd-5ddc-ac60-498b82a1f309" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450822}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8e786624-3795-5bd2-9044-40e13fec09b2" :question/math-academy-id "q-157162" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that two vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2} & =-2\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275381 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b32cae0a-cfa4-5a48-bec0-bec8d7dc3e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449738} {:answer/id #uuid "6d898115-c0eb-5d34-a917-b7dcf7a96360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449739}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b32cae0a-cfa4-5a48-bec0-bec8d7dc3e30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449738} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e4a2d88-db64-5b31-a70f-9ea4ef7e3add" :answer-field/key "$-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450823} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6344cc8-bb74-5e6c-9860-774ada96f354" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449740} {:answer/id #uuid "050a05d6-6400-526a-a36f-ba1b9194ee43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "050a05d6-6400-526a-a36f-ba1b9194ee43" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449741} :answer-field/id #uuid "5467665c-f7b2-59ad-ab79-2399fd1df6d3" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450824} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7cd399a4-4400-5571-ba68-3479c6931057" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449742} {:answer/id #uuid "5d77d526-ac50-5cf3-9c88-9acb57c981b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d77d526-ac50-5cf3-9c88-9acb57c981b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449743} :answer-field/id #uuid "b615c788-1967-500e-ab0a-355ff0e497b9" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450825}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "97d72a17-2281-52f3-a3f9-d658f3c735d4" :question/math-academy-id "q-157224" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =-2\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-2+0 \\\\ 0+4+0 \\\\ 2-2+15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 15\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -4{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}+5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -4{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is true. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$”; “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275382 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "450fa0a5-918f-5572-9d4e-0b23223efc3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449744} {:answer/id #uuid "23cf3255-62a9-50d7-83d5-aad80f2be23e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "450fa0a5-918f-5572-9d4e-0b23223efc3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449744} :answer-field/id #uuid "0e12d85f-e55d-5d26-8fa7-a1c3fe6525fb" :answer-field/key "${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-5{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450826} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76952045-4272-5683-a72d-0d539b0d0ea9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449746} {:answer/id #uuid "59df24fa-d195-5cce-8336-25ea10186942" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "59df24fa-d195-5cce-8336-25ea10186942" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449747} :answer-field/id #uuid "9b14a133-075b-551e-91bc-74ee67241348" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450827} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d3a43103-bf7b-525c-95cb-71da87d6c0ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449748} {:answer/id #uuid "69f5f534-bfae-593c-81fc-b32117697d1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3a43103-bf7b-525c-95cb-71da87d6c0ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449748} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3618720-e80e-5dc7-a706-380306c42caa" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450828}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "3b60b8aa-49bb-5ecd-ad04-b68a0c43f769" :question/math-academy-id "q-157225" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-5{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-5{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -20\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+0+0 \\\\ 5+0-9 \\\\ -2-20+3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -19\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-3{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{1} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275383 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} {:answer/id #uuid "ec3f999c-abdd-5a87-9204-4b13bfc2361d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449751}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f767d9b-3d4e-520a-b769-f05609c5dfc3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449750} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c0d7ec0-7274-56ea-8e17-5dc902e217cf" :answer-field/key "$-{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+5{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450829} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c2d0dc78-91a3-5567-80a0-214fb535e9ef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449752} {:answer/id #uuid "7ce350bd-6e6f-54e0-816d-4d9658486f5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ce350bd-6e6f-54e0-816d-4d9658486f5c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449753} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e6ab5e6-2163-5059-b629-4a9cdb0438ae" :a