type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449760} :answer-field/id #uuid "7d53b19f-2e5d-5abf-b204-2e3efa435c32" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450834}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2473ef72-1c36-57f9-bdd5-12c0b04c9229" :question/math-academy-id "q-157236" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1-3+4 \\\\ 5-6+1 \\\\ 2-12+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since statement ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}={x}_{3}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=-3.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent” is false. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is ${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186275385 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2254be2b-f993-5682-a9c7-9d6c1aa8a420" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449762} {:answer/id #uuid "b8837dad-34d4-5dd1-84f6-3b476d98748a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449763}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b8837dad-34d4-5dd1-84f6-3b476d98748a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449763} :answer-field/id #uuid "00d1f4c0-204e-570d-a62f-76800bbc9dc9" :answer-field/key "${\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450835} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3f5e3379-8dc5-5670-a262-f7d4e0946e5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449764} {:answer/id #uuid "91f14290-9d9f-5a69-bb74-76a89ebaae95" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449765}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3f5