 linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452520}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "cd19f076-6276-574d-a171-58c6f862f950" :question/math-academy-id "q-157239" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $5{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =5\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -10 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+3\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5-2-3 \\\\ -10+1+9 \\\\ -5-1+6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since statement $5{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}=5,\\,{x}_{2}=-1$ and ${x}_{3}=3.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is true. Since statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $5{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+3{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$; “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186381146 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bdcfad6c-8f67-57f0-8e1a-a5145e94e79b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453424} {:answer/id #uuid "55aeaac9-a576-5295-97bc-ebd0c9e7e4e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453425}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "55aeaac9-a576-5295-97bc-ebd0c9e7e4e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453425} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f9ba92f-81fd-578e-97ef-9822e2732b3c" :answer-field/key "$-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454462} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22fb0a31-52f6-57f8-8ea5-865c224e4380" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453426} {:answer/id #uuid "6acfaf3d-0245-5aea-b43a-808e8113c3a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453427}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "22fb0a31-52f6-57f8-8ea5-865c224e4380" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453426} :answer-field/id #uuid "