matrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since statement $-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=1.$\n\n- Statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent” is true. Since statement $-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$; “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511507 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f1ad91a1-7380-5cb7-9b05-bbbc9af7d936" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755898} {:answer/id #uuid "e72d47e5-9f43-5237-bf0d-50bbcf7a1bd6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755899}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f1ad91a1-7380-5cb7-9b05-bbbc9af7d936" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755898} :answer-field/id #uuid "709c845c-eb5f-5c4e-8cb9-b64a9017988a" :answer-field/key "$-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755897} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5a3995b0-7fc3-5c97-b54a-7c33762a5a9b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755901} {:answer/id #uuid "26508143-ceac-5769-8b36-668e397a0764" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755902}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26508143-ceac-5769-8b36-668e397a0764" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755902} :answer-field/id #uuid "69baf08f-406a-58cb-85ea-bcde35edf71d" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755900} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "345678fd-9ed2-55de-aea8-4dc684a2a8e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755904} {:answer/id #uuid "650d99fb-d04d-535c-8b8e-327b68d7522e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755905}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "650d99fb-d04d-535c-8b8e-327b68d7522e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755905} :answer-field/id #uuid "4339894d-b06d-5035-aafe-f193e2a6cc8d" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755903}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "6d3ae80f-587f-5674-9679-5efb33bf0d2c" :question/math-academy-id "q-157227" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =-3\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12+0+2 \\\\ 3+6+4 \\\\ 0+0+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186564502 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae6672d7-cb8d-55c7-9e22-934f78536932" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755916} {:answer/id #uuid "47e213ed-ce8f-5b35-b7f7-22ff4b6cf322" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755917}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae6672d7-cb8d-55c7-9e22-934f78536932" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755916} :answer-field/id #uuid "4b1f1a17-f1fe-56b4-a815-029ac23b9c83" :answer-field/key "$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755915} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56e932a1-8103-5f1a-b2de-3f3fdf88deb1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755919} {:answer/id #uuid "d2f38d04-2b33-5450-9f1b-c007c584badc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755920}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56e932a1-8103-5f1a-b2de-3f3fdf88deb1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755919} :answer-field/id #uuid "1bb6e731-b390-54b7-83a3-519a5fa30109" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755918} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32a621de-dd0f-53e7-b651-3a1d9b589b7b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755922} {:answer/id #uuid "d3e412c8-c9a2-54ac-a063-aff9bb8c2290" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d3e412c8-c9a2-54ac-a063-aff9bb8c2290" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755923} :answer-field/id #uuid "f2525ba9-478e-5c95-a4c2-ab161c046ae5" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755921}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "848dcb43-d675-54a9-ae47-a5c4f5dfb881" :question/math-academy-id "q-157254" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "We say that two vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}=2{x}_{2}.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186572667 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e12ce938-55fd-5b8e-aa74-ad38e2d79e2e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755925} {:answer/id #uuid "7ed54190-1a5b-5f2b-a389-f80e70eece0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755926}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ed54190-1a5b-5f2b-a389-f80e70eece0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755926} :answer-field/id #uuid "25efb205-ad57-5f7d-a185-76e284bc0771" :answer-field/key "$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755924} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4583430-7c83-5bbb-8212-9645191e54de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755928} {:answer/id #uuid "6f74b06d-f41f-56f2-abbf-5c1270ea7000" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755929}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4583430-7c83-5bbb-8212-9645191e54de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755928} :answer-field/id #uuid "c540af96-b65d-533e-8bcc-adb51155b8b4" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755927} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "92d039cb-e0f9-5c47-976d-fde354577f81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755931} {:answer/id #uuid "15fd28e5-e940-5e58-87d2-54f1fadeb58a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755932}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "15fd28e5-e940-5e58-87d2-54f1fadeb58a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755932} :answer-field/id #uuid "175ece7b-0760-53fc-aea7-2590bee64ca0" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755930}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0bcf3acb-d9f4-5535-b8d1-de8e7ee2e9d3" :question/math-academy-id "q-157235" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -14 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-4-2 \\\\ 9+5-14 \\\\ -3+3+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since the statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}=3,\\,{x}_{2}=-1$ and ${x}_{3}=2.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707061 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32e8d528-a72d-5d9e-98b4-0499a261e4ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755970} {:answer/id #uuid "4d0dcae3-97da-5fe2-bef1-f9b81fb5fc85" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755971}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d0dcae3-97da-5fe2-bef1-f9b81fb5fc85" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755971} :answer-field/id #uuid "02f60d8a-8f75-5ff1-aef7-9eefd1c007a2" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755969} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b8b5a3f-fbb7-5c4d-b6a6-5a672a684655" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755973} {:answer/id #uuid "d83a48e2-51fb-5106-9d6f-63b7a45c4690" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755974}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6b8b5a3f-fbb7-5c4d-b6a6-5a672a684655" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755973} :answer-field/id #uuid "7d5b0b7a-2cca-553b-a387-d33f6bfd3d44" :answer-field/key "$-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755972} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fddd6e40-99da-523e-8b26-c4e9490daa04" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755976} {:answer/id #uuid "6217f12a-3184-558c-80f9-08d4ebfb98ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755977}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6217f12a-3184-558c-80f9-08d4ebfb98ff" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755977} :answer-field/id #uuid "ab73944e-bcd0-579f-8774-2b870ace1c6e" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755975}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2737af81-df2e-5d8a-91c5-34eaa8a14f0f" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\ne\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} &=0 \\\\ x_{1}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ -x_{1}+x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nRead a coordinate with just one remaining unknown at each step:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{1}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=0 \\\\ (0)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=0 \\\\ -(0)+x_{2}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery coefficient must be zero. Thus the homogeneous equation has only the trivial solution and the set is **linearly independent**.\n\nA failed candidate alone does not prove independence; the homogeneous-equation argument settles the classification.\n\nThe statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **true**. The statement “$-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **false**. The statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is **true**."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707068 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50fcd3b3-bf74-5491-9a55-636eb33e4f08" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755979} {:answer/id #uuid "b21b4a4a-e59d-582c-b09b-ddf332f1eef3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755980}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b21b4a4a-e59d-582c-b09b-ddf332f1eef3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755980} :answer-field/id #uuid "00dc05ed-9711-5c0b-a91e-592954b81093" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755978} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6dc54d18-eb51-51b3-b059-db27771a2772" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755982} {:answer/id #uuid "af2b969d-20b7-570e-a049-0c10b76d1675" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755983}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6dc54d18-eb51-51b3-b059-db27771a2772" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755982} :answer-field/id #uuid "cf8022b2-1470-54df-a201-411921520435" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755981} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c3cd9a48-9a2b-5060-b945-2c6b5f9ac932" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755985} {:answer/id #uuid "5a4a3334-c7aa-55c0-ab03-d4eec8a4a558" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755986}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c3cd9a48-9a2b-5060-b945-2c6b5f9ac932" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755985} :answer-field/id #uuid "e3387586-97b4-569b-a244-784d61a48251" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755984}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4953e9ef-0ea9-5b1f-a215-edec95e4c2bd" :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x_{2}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0 &=0 \\\\ x_{1}-x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nChoose one coefficient nonzero and solve the remaining coordinate equations by substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{2}&=1 \\\\ -2(1)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=2 \\\\ x_{1}-(1)&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives a nontrivial solution. Verify it directly:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nThe coefficients are not all zero, so the set is **linearly dependent**.\n\nThe statement “$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **true**. The statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **false**. The statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is **false**."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707084 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "90824efb-2eb9-5da4-8799-f3cc4ca74971" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755988} {:answer/id #uuid "4f7f419a-41f8-5607-b3b9-f6256017ac64" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755989}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "90824efb-2eb9-5da4-8799-f3cc4ca74971" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755988} :answer-field/id #uuid "6231bbee-3e57-5bb8-b41a-fa66ae11dbee" :answer-field/key "$2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-2\\mathbf{a}_{2}-2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186755987} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87e31f97-fc5f-5a0e-82d5-b64d097a3dbb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218675