are not all zero, so the set is **linearly dependent**.\n\nThe statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent.” is **true**. The statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **false**. The statement “$-\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}-2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **true**."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707100 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "31a0c3f1-4d07-5f81-b8c9-fe540f580384" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756029} {:answer/id #uuid "fac40e09-78dc-5ba1-b2d9-212ea02d1f72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756030}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "31a0c3f1-4d07-5f81-b8c9-fe540f580384" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756029} :answer-field/id #uuid "b90baa65-8cd3-5ec1-ac5f-443c3a97ac45" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756028} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a6a348b-8d6b-5967-b4b5-0f995517afdb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756032} {:answer/id #uuid "06e16b5e-3d48-577b-b6a9-5325e17dfb90" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756033}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0a6a348b-8d6b-5967-b4b5-0f995517afdb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756032} :answer-field/id #uuid "6ef3ed06-bd2f-5d2c-97b3-6600e1dcc16e" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186756031